a-lang (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=low

  * Release @VERSION_NAME@, version code @VERSION_CODE@.
  * The A compiler (ac): native executables for Linux (x86-64, ARM64,
    RISC-V 64, LoongArch64), Windows (x86-64) and Android (ARM64, x86-64,
    RISC-V 64) without an external assembler, linker or C library.
  * A standard library of 100+ modules written in A: text, collections,
    numbers, data formats, cryptography and TLS 1.3, networking, the C
    library, a GUI toolkit with a display server, a terminal UI toolkit and
    the editor libraries of AIDE.
  * "The A Programming Language": a book as an Aytict-branded HTML site and
    an EPUB, with compiled and run code samples (/usr/share/doc/a-lang).
  * Man page, bash completion, Vim and nano syntax files.

 -- Aytict <https://aytict.fi>  @DATE@
